Package: lazydocker-gui
Version: 1.0.3-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-tk, ca-certificates, x-terminal-emulator | gnome-terminal | kgx | konsole | xfce4-terminal
Maintainer: Local Package Builder <root@localhost>
Description: desktop manager and launcher for Lazydocker
 A small desktop application that checks Docker CE and Lazydocker, reports
 available releases, and starts Lazydocker in the user's terminal emulator.
